codex
The abstract’s suggested “threshold graph” direction is misleading: its headline hard result is List \(k\)-Coloring on split graphs, while several threshold-adjacent regimes are FPT. I’m reading the proofs now to determine whether the split-graph reduction yields a plantable search family without leaving the proven hard regime.
